# Everything the Playwright suite writes: its own uploads, the HTML report,
# traces and screenshots of failures, and the argon2 hash it caches between the
# global setup and the workers. All of it is reproducible by re-running.
e2e/.artifacts/

# Uploaded attachments. Whatever UPLOAD_DIR points at is user data, not source:
# it is written at runtime, it is what a deployment's volume is for, and it is
# the one directory here that must never end up in a commit or an image layer.
apps/api/storage/
